Vendored syntax highlighting grammars for pi's TUI code blocks.

Most files in this directory are unmodified `.sublime-syntax` grammars from
https://github.com/sublimehq/Packages, vendored so syntect
(default-features = false, no bundled dumps) can build a curated syntax set
via `include_str!`. The upstream license (sublimehq/Packages/LICENSE) reads:

    Permission to copy, use, modify, sell and distribute this
    software is granted. This software is provided "as is" without
